What happens here?

```kotlin
coroutineScope {
    async { delay(100); throw IOException("risk down") }
    delay(1_000)
    println("after")
}
```

What does this do?

```kotlin
val handler = CoroutineExceptionHandler { _, e -> log.warn("failed", e) }
coroutineScope {
    launch(handler) { throw IOException("webhook 503") }
}
```

No handler is installed anywhere. What happens?

```kotlin
supervisorScope {
    launch { throw IOException("sms down") }
